AUTHORIZED ENDPOINT BOOTSTRAP NOTICE
------------------------------------
This repository contains public command-line bootstrap scripts solely intended
for authorized SYKids parents and administrators to provision enrolled family
or school devices using a valid one-time installation ticket issued from an
authenticated SYKids Dashboard.

1. Scope of Permission
   Authorized SYKids users are permitted to download, inspect, and execute the
   CLI bootstrap scripts in this repository for the sole purpose of enrolling
   devices they own or are legally authorized to manage.

2. Proprietary Core Software
   All core SYKids Server software, SYKids Windows/Linux/Android Client agents,
   installer binaries, protocols, and associated intellectual property remain
   strictly proprietary and confidential property of SYKids Protection Platform.
   No license or right to redistribute, reverse-engineer, modify, or sublicense
   the core SYKids Server or Client binaries is granted by this repository.

3. Disclaimer
   THE BOOTSTRAP SCRIPTS ARE PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND,
   EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF
   MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, AND NONINFRINGEMENT.
